  "title": "U.P.E. Addon - Jeb_ Portal",
  "description": "Adds a visual effect to the portal in the style of the renamed sheep jeb.",
  "body": "![Title](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/456a5b29ace6d900d894abcd8a43e239dd54d91e.png)\n\nAdds a visual effect to the portal in the style of the renamed sheep jeb_ .\nSimply rename one of the pieces of leather armor, and your portal will shimmer with the colors of a \"jeb_\" sheep.\nFor proper operation on versions BELOW 1.21.5, a mod implementing CIT (Custom Item Textures) is required.\nFor versions ABOVE 1.21.5+, no modifications are required (except perhaps the U.P.E. Addon - Connector Ultima, if you want to play with multiple addons).",
